{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_82_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_82","textTraditional":"一、十有九年，春王三月，宋人執滕子嬰齊。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_82_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_82","textTraditional":"二、夏六月，宋人、曹人、邾婁人盟于曹南。鄫子會盟于邾婁。己酉，邾婁人執鄫子用之。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_82_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_82","textTraditional":"其言會盟何？後會也。己酉，邾婁人執鄫子用之。惡乎用之？用之社也。其用之社奈何？蓋叩其鼻以血社也。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_82_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_82","textTraditional":"三、秋，宋人圍曹。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_82_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_82","textTraditional":"四、衞人伐邢。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_82_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_82","textTraditional":"五、冬，公會陳人、蔡人、楚人、鄭人盟于齊。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_cdt_82_7","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_82","textTraditional":"六、梁亡。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_cdt_82_8","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_82","textTraditional":"此未有伐者，其言梁亡何？自亡也。其自亡奈何？魚爛而亡也。","sentenceOrder":8}],"overrides":{}}